ItemDescription,A condensed sphere of living tidewater launched as infinite ranged ammunition from a sling.,Una esfera condensada de agua de marea viviente lanzada como munición a distancia infinita desde una honda.
ItemDescription,"An arcane synthesis scroll. Reading it consumes an Aghanim's Scepter you wield or carry, permanently granting its hero ability upgrade while freeing your weapon slot (without the scepter's raw stats).",
ItemDescription,"The scepter of a wizard with demigod-like powers. Wielding it in a weapon hand grants +2 to all attributes, +12 max life, +9 max mana, and upgrades a DOTA2 hero's signature ability.",
ItemDescription,"With origins known only to a single wizard, fragments of this impossible crystal are nearly as coveted as the renowned scepter itself. Rubbing it permanently consumes the shard to unlock a DOTA2 hero's Aghanim's Shard upgrade.",
ItemName,aghanims blessing,
ItemName,aghanims scepter,
ItemName,aghanims shard,
ItemName,tidal orb,orbe de marea
